    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*Eligible for Vacant Home Grant*\r\n\r\nGrimes take great pleasure in bringing to the market this fine home in this most desirable of locations. Stella Lodge represents a truly rare and unrivalled opportunity to purchase a family home in a prime location. Stella Lodge is a spacious detached bungalow located on a substantial site with potential to develop, subject to planning permission.   \r\n\r\nBuilt in 1960, accommodation on the ground floor comprises entrance hall, shower room, living room, kitchen / dining room, conservatory and 3 bedrooms. Upstairs there are a further 2 generous bedrooms (master en suite) and a bathroom. The property further benefits from a large rear garden with vehicular access, side access and a driveway with off-street parking to the front.  \r\n\r\nSituated in Artane, a mature and settled area, the location is second to none. The area is well-serviced by public transport - there are quality bus corridors operating along the Malahide Road and providing efficient links to the City Centre servicing the 14, 15, 27, 27A, 27B. 42, 43 and N2 routes. In addition to this, there are an abundance of excellent schools and sporting facilities in the immediate vicinity as well as St. Anne’s Park which is just a short stroll away. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport and Beaumont Hospital are also within close proximity."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:  \r\nAccessed via a porch, wide hallway with ample storage presses and laminate flooring  \r\n\r\nShower Room: \r\nFully tiled, with WC, wash hand basin with storage and bath with shower attachment \r\n\r\nLiving Room: \r\nLarge bright room to the front of the house with wood-burning stove and laminate flooring  \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining / Family Room: \r\nModern kitchen with ample presses and generous dining space. Access to:  \r\n\r\nConservatory: \r\nBright room to the rear of the property with access to rear \r\n\r\nBedroom 5:  \r\nSingle bedroom located at the rear of the house with laminate flooring  \r\n\r\nBedroom 4:  \r\nDouble bedroom situated to the rear of the house with laminate flooring  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  \r\nGenerous sized bedroom situated to the side of the house with laminate flooring and built-in shelving units \r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nLanding: \r\nWith laminate flooring and Velux \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  \r\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring and Velux \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \r\nDouble bedroom with laminate flooring, Velux and access to: \r\n\r\nEn Suite Bathroom: \r\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin and walk-in shower \r\n\r\nOutside:  \r\nSubstantial side and rear garden with vehicular access from Rockfield Estate to a large workshop / triple garage. There is a also a driveway to the front with off-street parking, wide side access and a walled front garden laid in lawn \r\n\r\nServices: \r\nGas Fired Central Heating  \r\nVehicular access to large garage / workshop \r\nLarge driveway with off-street parking and side access  \r\nDouble glazed PVC windows throughout  \r\n\r\nBER Details: \r\nBER:  E1\r\nBER No:   119448504\r\nEnergy Performance Indicator:  310.35\r\n\r\nContents: \r\nFixtures and fittings, non-integrated appliances \r\nCarpet, Blinds, Garden Shed, light fittings"
      },
